---
import SidebarRightContainer from '@alfadormx/blocks/layout/SidebarRightContainer.astro';
import Headline from '@alfadormx/blocks/primitives/Headline.astro';
---

<SidebarRightContainer
  htmlTag="section"
  containerWidthType="full"
  content={{
    widthType: 'boxed',
    spacing: { padding: 'py-12' },
    border: { width: 'border', color: 'border-border-emphasis border-dotted' },
  }}
  border={{ width: 'border', color: 'border-border' }}
  gap="loose"
  spacing={{ margin: 'mb-8' }}
>
  <div slot="main" class="bg-surface p-8 rounded border border-border">
    <Headline
      title="API Authentication Guide"
      htmlTag="h4"
      class="my-0"
      titleClass="mb-4 text-3xl"
    />
    <div class="text-sm text-muted mb-6">Last updated: December 25, 2025</div>
    <p>
      Learn how to authenticate your API requests securely using our authentication system. This
      guide covers OAuth 2.0, API keys, and best practices for secure integration.
    </p>
    <Headline title="Getting Started" htmlTag="h4" class="mt-6 mb-0" titleClass="mb-2 text-xl" />
    <p>
      Before making API calls, you'll need to obtain credentials from your developer dashboard.
      Choose the authentication method that best fits your use case.
    </p>
    <Headline title="API Keys" htmlTag="h4" class="mt-6 mb-0" titleClass="mb-2 text-xl" />
    <p>
      API keys are simple to use and perfect for server-to-server communication. Keep your keys
      secure and never expose them in client-side code.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="sidebar" class="space-y-6">
    <div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded border border-border">
      <Headline title="On This Page" htmlTag="h4" class="my-0" titleClass="mb-3 text-lg" />
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li>
          <a href="#" class="text-sm text-link hover:underline">
            Getting Started
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="#" class="text-sm text-link hover:underline">
            API Keys
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="#" class="text-sm text-link hover:underline">
            OAuth 2.0
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="#" class="text-sm text-link hover:underline">
            Best Practices
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-surface p-6 rounded border border-border">
      <Headline title="Related Docs" htmlTag="h4" class="my-0" titleClass="mb-3 text-lg" />
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li>
          <a href="#" class="text-sm text-link hover:underline">
            Rate Limiting
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="#" class="text-sm text-link hover:underline">
            Error Handling
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="#" class="text-sm text-link hover:underline">
            Webhooks
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-warning/10 p-4 rounded border border-warning">
      <p class="text-xs text-normal">
        <strong>Note:</strong> API v1 will be deprecated on June 1, 2026.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</SidebarRightContainer>
